---
import WhatsAppIcon from './icons/WhatsAppIcon.astro';
import { waLink } from '../site';
---

<section class="bg-electric-950 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
      Siap membuat ruangan Anda kembali dingin &amp; sehat?
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-electric-100/80">
      Konsultasi gratis via WhatsApp. Teknisi kami siap membantu hari ini di
      Bandung Raya &amp; sekitarnya.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
      <a
        href={waLink('Halo Nadeera Teknik! Saya mau pesan jasa AC sekarang.')}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent-500 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/30 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-600"
      >
        <WhatsAppIcon class="h-5 w-5" />
        Pesan Teknisi Sekarang
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>